room lagoon_shore "Gullet Key — the Lagoon Shore"
  bg bg_shore_wide
  width 2560
  music music_sea
  ambience sea
  perspective horizon 470 ref 875 height 310
  walk (60,875) (140,770) (900,762) (1350,690) (2000,650) (2450,690) (2520,875)
  entry 950,800
  arrive reef_wreck 900,800
  arrive key_gate 2200,720

  # Atmosphere: the lagoon at the boat, sun on the water.
  footsteps sand
  water (840,520) (1000,520) (1000,568) (1240,568) (1390,515) (1300,620) (1100,670) (840,700) ripple 1.6
  water (335,548) (640,546) (660,522) (800,522) (806,545) (805,575) (360,632) (338,600) ripple 1.4
  motes glints (840,520) (1000,520) (1000,568) (1240,568) (1390,515) (1300,620) (1100,670) (840,700) count 20
  emit lapping at 900,640

  sprite npc_quill_body at 640,800 size 0.98 idle speaker quill for quill grade "saturate(0.88) brightness(0.95)"

  hotspot lagoon "the lagoon"
    area 0,500 1400x200
    stand 1000,790
    look "Turquoise, shallow, warm. The kind of lagoon sailors describe in letters home, to make somebody jealous."
    use "I'd need something to carry it in."
    pickup "I'd need something to carry it in."

  hotspot cutter "the grey cutter"
    area 980,0 300x570
    nowalk
    look "A grey cutter at anchor across the lagoon. Fast, narrow, very clean. A cloud on her stern. Cray's cloud. She isn't fishing."
    talk "Nobody waves back. Somebody aboard her is watching us through a glass, politely."

  hotspot palms "the palms"
    area 0,0 900x480
    nowalk
    look "Palms leaning out over the water like customers at a bar. Gullet Key is beautiful. Nobody told me prisons could be beautiful."

  hotspot boat "the boat"
    area 320,540 520x215
    stand 880,800
    exit reef_wreck sound none
    look "The jolly boat, pulled up on the sand, ready for the row back out to the wreck."
    open "We row back out to the wreck. I'm improving. Quill says I've gone from terrible to merely upsetting."
    use "We row back out to the wreck. I'm improving. Quill says I've gone from terrible to merely upsetting."

  hotspot path "the path to the palisade"
    area 1760,60 800x520
    stand 2200,720
    exit key_gate sound none
    look "A sandy path up between the dunes to a palisade of sharpened logs and a yellow flag. Yellow means sickness. These days it means Cray."
    open "Up the path, toward the yellow flag."

  hotspot quill "Quill"
    area 555,480 170x310
    stand 820,800
    look "Quill shades her eyes at the grey cutter. She doesn't like it. She doesn't like most things, but she's specific about this one."
    talk "She answers without taking her eyes off the cutter."
      talk quill3 at shore
    give "“Hold on to it. If that cutter comes across, I want both hands free.”"
    states none

  combos fill_bucket
  combos quill_combos
